--- !u!114 &6644693220286883705
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3130808877707493110}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c78f3469548ae2b44bec77ce71d4f008, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FunFactDatabase
  funFacts:
  - '"I hate bees, so I was happy to see a headline saying bee populations are declining!
    Then I read the article, and apparently bees are necessary for biodiversity and
    food security. I think I can come to terms with bees."'
  - '"When I have a sore throat, I swallow some honey to soothe it. Whoever it was
    thousands of years ago that found out honey is not just great in coffee but is
    medicinal... that''s the GOAT."'
  - '"Bees eat pollen for protein! Can you believe that!? And get this. Pollination
    is accidental! I can''t even be that helpful on purpose!"'
  - '"I could never be a bee. They go to, like, thousands of flowers a day, but my
    allergies wouldn''t allow for that." '
  - '"I love that I can get produce from the local garden, because it doesn''t have
    the carbon footprint of imported produce. That said, apparently bees travel tens
    of thousands of miles to produce a pound of honey? Thankfully they don''t have
    methane farts."'
  - '"I''m so glad that the local garden comes to the farmer''s market every week.
    I feel much more attached to my neighbors and the food I eat. It''s all familiar
    with the same dirt!"'
  - '"After finding out that fresh local produce can be more nutritious and fresh
    than the big-box stuff, I don''t think I''ll ever go back to a normal grocery
    store. Except Costco. I love Costco."'
  - '"No one talks about the carbon emissions of landfills, and it drives me nuts!
    I tell everyone to get their produce from the local garden because there''s less
    packaging waste. Plus, theres so much food waste that happens before food reaches
    the store, that doesn''t happen with local produce!"'
  - '"I would love to volunteer or work at the local garden. That kind of work gives
    me a sense of purpose."'
  - '"At the grocery store, I get so distracted and end up buying twice what I came
    for... and most of it is junk! But at my local farmer''s market, I get what I
    need, and I know it''s gonna be good. I replaced chips with the local garden''s
    sunflower seeds, plus a little salt!"'
  - '"At the grocery store, I get so distracted and end up buying twice what I came
    for... and most of it is junk! But at my local farmer''s market, I get what I
    need, and I know it''s gonna be good. I replaced chips with the local garden''s
    sunflower seeds, plus a little salt!"'
  - '"As a public planner, It''s great to be able to trace where all the local produce
    comes from in case anything goes wrong."'
  - '"I knew the guy who started our local garden. I swear he has the best tomatoes
    in the world. I don''t even like tomatoes."'
  - '"I know it''s not actually bad, but I don''t like that the apples at the store
    are coated in wax. It just sounds weird! No such thing at my neighbor''s garden,
    though."'
  - '"I love walkable cities, which is why I wanted to move here. The weekly farmer''s
    market sealed the deal for me."'
  - '"I like my local garden because when the produce is in season, it''s cheaper
    than the grocery store. I don''t bother when it''s out of season because of the
    emissions."'
  - '"I don''t mind that my local garden charges a little higher than the grocery
    store. I like that the money is going to a kind person next door instead of some
    suits that don''t care about me."'
  - '"I love bees so much!! Did you know that we would go extinct without them??????
    Yeah! Yeah! So next time you get stung by a bee, THANK IT FOR ITS SERVICE!!!!"'
  - '"Bees are so cute! They actually dance to communicate."'
  - '"If bees can smell 50 times better than dogs, why don''t cops start using bees
    instead?"'
  - '"Appparently male bees only exist to mate. I don''t have anything interesting
    to add to that."'
  - '"Someone told me scientists use bees to measure ecosystem health. I thought
    they just made honey and stung people."'
